# 第五百零七部　预算化问题的紧圆周形式

定义圆周可行集：

$$
\boxed{
\mathscr M_{L,a}(C)
=
\left\{
\mu\ge0:
\begin{array}{l}
\mu(\mathbb T)\le C,\\
\displaystyle
\int\Gamma_{a,\phi}\,d\mu
=
\langle\mathfrak W_L,\phi\rangle\\
\forall\phi\in C_c^\infty((-2L,2L))
\end{array}
\right\}.
}
\tag{507.1}
$$

定义 Haar floor：

$$
\boxed{
\operatorname{hfloor}(\mu)
=
\sup
\left\{
\alpha\ge0:
\mu\ge\alpha m_{\mathbb T}
\right\}.
}
\tag{507.2}
$$

